*one* super-threatening monster in each of several classes.
L: arch-lich.
Master liches have been nerfed and can no longer teleport away when
injured.
W: Nazgul.
Debilitating remote stunning attack.
a: locust.
Disease attack. *SWARMS*. Can be summoned with nasties, including a
"magical eye"/beholder whose gaze slows you so much that locusts can
theoretically kill you before you react.
h: Master mind flayers.
Can spawn *next* to you in a nasty swarm, while regular mind flayers
cannot. Huge difference.
I'd much rather have uncursed scrolls of genocide deal with these
monsters than take a blessed-geno crapshoot.
